<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Thank you for joining us last night, and what's next</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Masterclass 2 is Thursday 12 November, and ISF Forum 2026 is on Saturday 28 November in Ibadan.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-section padding="0px" />
      <mj-column padding="0px" />
      <mj-image padding="0px" />
      <mj-text color="#222222" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" padding="0 36px 16px 36px" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      a { color: #1E6F64; }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        .hero div { font-size: 30px !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F2F4F3" width="600px">

    <mj-section padding="22px 0 10px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.5" color="#5E6B68" align="center" padding="0 24px">ISF Forum 2026 &middot; Saturday 28 November &middot; ICC Ibadan</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Header -->
    <mj-section background-color="#0F1F1D" border-radius="6px 6px 0 0" padding="38px 0 34px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="13px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="3px" color="#5CC2B1" padding="0 30px 12px 30px">VIRTUAL MASTERCLASS</mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="hero" align="center" font-family="Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" font-size="38px" line-height="1.15" color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 30px 14px 30px">Thank you for joining us</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#B9C7C4" padding="0 44px">How Investors Read Your Deck, and what comes next</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="34px 0 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hi there,</mj-text>
        <mj-text>Thank you to everyone who joined How Investors Read Your Deck last night. The turnout and the questions were brilliant, and a big thank you to Oladimeji Timothy, Country Director of inDrive Nigeria, for being so generous with his time.</mj-text>
        <mj-text>Three quick things before you go back to your deck:</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- 1 -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="4px 36px 12px 36px">
      <mj-column background-color="#EEF6F4" border-radius="6px" padding="22px 0 6px 0">
        <mj-text font-size="13px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" color="#1E6F64" padding="0 24px 6px 24px">1. KEEP THE MOMENTUM GOING</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 8px 24px">Our second masterclass is on <strong>Thursday 12 November at 6:00 PM WAT</strong>:</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="19px" line-height="1.35" font-weight="700" color="#0F1F1D" padding="0 24px 6px 24px">The Numbers That Matter: Traction, Unit Economics and Your Funding Ask</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 10px 24px">With Yvonne-Faith Elaigwu, Head of Operations and Governance, OnePipe.</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 12px 24px">If last night was about how investors read your deck, this one is about the numbers they look for inside it. Register below and we will send you the Zoom link.</mj-text>
        <mj-image src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaxlinksG/email-templates/isf-newsletter-assets/isf-2026/masterclass-nov/masterclass-2-numbers-that-matter.jpg" width="380px" padding="0 24px 18px 24px" border-radius="6px" align="center" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxDAwtyYrubnd839tW7-UhuUfAxdFs5mtvIThYTWdy_Unpxg/viewform" alt="Virtual Masterclass: The Numbers That Matter, Traction, Unit Economics and Your Funding Ask, with Yvonne-Faith Elaigwu, Head of Operations and Governance, OnePipe. Thursday 12 November 2026, 6:00 PM WAT, on Zoom." />
        <mj-button href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxDAwtyYrubnd839tW7-UhuUfAxdFs5mtvIThYTWdy_Unpxg/viewform" background-color="#1E6F64" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="14px" font-weight="700" border-radius="4px" inner-padding="10px 22px" align="left" padding="0 24px 22px 24px">Register for Masterclass 2</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- 2 -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 36px 12px 36px">
      <mj-column background-color="#EEF6F4" border-radius="6px" padding="22px 0 6px 0">
        <mj-text font-size="13px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" color="#1E6F64" padding="0 24px 6px 24px">2. PUT IT TO WORK IN THE ROOM</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 10px 24px">On <strong>Saturday 28 November</strong>, ISF Forum 2026 brings founders, investors and government together at the International Conference Centre, Ibadan, jointly convened with the Oyo State Government. You'll find:</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 8px 24px">&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Deck Teardown:</strong> real founder decks rebuilt live by investors including Satoshi Shinada (Verod-Kepple Africa Ventures) and Babatunde Akin-Moses (Sycamore)</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 8px 24px">&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Funding Your Next 12 Months:</strong> every kind of money open to your business this year</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 8px 24px">&bull;&nbsp; <strong>A Deal Room</strong> where founders meet investors one on one</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 16px 24px">&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Speakers</strong> including Kashifu Inuwa Abdullahi (DG, NITDA) and Chika Nwosu (MD, PalmPay)</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="6px 0 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Basic passes start at &#8358;5,000.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://tickets.theisfforum.com/#/buyTickets/selectTickets?lang=en" background-color="#1E6F64" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="16px" font-weight="700" border-radius="4px" inner-padding="14px 30px" align="left" padding="4px 36px 26px 36px">Get your pass</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- 3 -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 36px 8px 36px">
      <mj-column background-color="#EEF6F4" border-radius="6px" padding="22px 0 6px 0">
        <mj-text font-size="13px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" color="#1E6F64" padding="0 24px 6px 24px">3. BRING A FOUNDER</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 16px 24px">If someone you know is raising, forward them this email so they can join us on 12 November.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Sign-off -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="18px 0 8px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>See you next Thursday, and in Ibadan.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="6px 36px 34px 36px">Warm regards,<br />David Adeleke<br /><span style="color:#5E6B68;">Convener, ISF Forum 2026<br />david@theisfforum.com</span></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- FIXED BOTTOM: Ibadan banner -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0 0 6px 6px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaxlinksG/email-templates/isf-newsletter-assets/isf-2026/speakers-oct/isf-big-ideas-banner.jpg" width="600px" border-radius="0 0 6px 6px" href="https://theisfforum.com/forum" alt="ISF Forum 2026 banner showing the Ibadan skyline" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="22px 0 30px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px 6px 32px">ISF Forum &middot; Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px 6px 32px">You are receiving this email because you subscribed to updates from ISF Forum.</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px"><a href="{{UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}" style="color:#666666;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
